  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 203.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 203.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide a mechanism by which persons submitting information to the department can protect trade secrets.\n\nSource. #9361-A, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12344-A, eff 8-14-17",
